/**
 * Helper function to generate a gamma parameter, ensuring it's not within a bad range.
 * The gamma parameter is generated randomly between 0.5-0.9 or 1.1-1.5
 * This is to avoid gamma values close to 1.0 which can result in no visual change.
 *
 * @returns {number} A gamma parameter value that is not in the "bad range" (0.9 to 1.1).
